{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19971","headline":"游枋口 一 · 孟郊","name":"游枋口 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"一步复一步，出行千里幽。\n爲取山水意，故作寂寞游。\n太行青巅高，枋口碧照浮。\n明明无底镜，泛泛忘机鸥。\n老逸不自限，病狂不可周。\n恣闲饶淡薄，怠玩多淹留。\n芳物竞晼晚，绿梢挂新柔。\n和友莺相遶，言语亦以稠。\n始知万类然，静躁难相求。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟郊","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19971.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19971","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}